  <!-- EN: Acid bomb -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeAcid.label>酸弹</Weapon_GrenadeAcid.label>
  <!-- EN: Throwing missile filled up with hyperreactive liquids right up to the brim. The outer shell conserves the inner fluids with a special protective plastic layer. On contact, the pressure, unloads on contact in a deadly cloud of volitile acid.\n\nThe belt is loaded with these babies. -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeAcid.description>这是一种装满超反应性液体、直至满溢的投掷型弹药。外壳通过特殊的保护性塑料层将内部液体密封其中。一旦接触，压力会瞬间释放，形成一团致命的挥发性酸雾。

弹带上装满了这些小家伙。</Weapon_GrenadeAcid.description>
  <Weapon_GrenadeAcid.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>酸弹</Weapon_GrenadeAcid.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
  <!-- EN: Poison Ivy -->
  <Weapon_GrenadePoison.label>毒藤</Weapon_GrenadePoison.label>
  <!-- EN: Grenade that holds an huge amount of compressed gas inside. This very experimental version was originally processed by a mad scientist for bio warfare, somewhere in a secret military base asteroid (MBA).\n\nThere are illegible notes left behind: "Test record A51, Day 901, somewhere at the back of beyond. Zyklon E-V-E scored the best results of all substances. The gas has various cringe effects on body and mind, which end in loss of all body functions and motoric abilities. Especially the muscles don't appear to answer anymore, accompanied by uncontrollable shivering, the rate of the heart raises rapidly... until it stops beating. 1 minute and 55 seconds until time of death by test subject #201523. Boss will be happy." -->
  <Weapon_GrenadePoison.description>这枚手榴弹内部封存着大量压缩气体。这款极具实验性的版本最初是由一位疯狂科学家在某座位于小行星上的秘密军事基地（MBA）内，为生物战目的而研制。

现场留有字迹模糊的笔记：“测试记录A51，第901天，位于世外桃源某处。‘齐克隆E-V-E’在所有测试物质中表现最佳。该气体对身心产生多种令人毛骨悚然的影响，最终导致所有身体机能及运动能力丧失。 尤其是肌肉似乎不再作出反应，伴随着无法控制的颤抖，心率急剧上升……直至心脏停止跳动。距离实验对象死亡还有1分55秒。”</Weapon_GrenadePoison.description>
  <Weapon_GrenadePoison.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>毒藤</Weapon_GrenadePoison.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
  <!-- EN: Toxic Flask -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeToxic.label>有毒药剂瓶</Weapon_GrenadeToxic.label>
  <!-- EN: A very fragile flask filled with some brew of an alchemist. It whirls dreadful through the organism, until it reaches the brain cells. No one really knows, whats in, but the absurd effect, when its get shattered, speaks volumes. -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeToxic.description>一只极其易碎的烧瓶，内装着炼金术士调制的某种药剂。药剂在生物体内以令人毛骨悚然的方式翻腾，直至抵达脑细胞。虽然没人真正知道里面装了什么，但当烧瓶碎裂时所产生的荒诞效果，已足以说明一切。</Weapon_GrenadeToxic.description>
  <Weapon_GrenadeToxic.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>有毒药剂瓶</Weapon_GrenadeToxic.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
  <!-- EN: Hornet Nest -->
  <Weapon_HornetNest.label>大黄蜂巢</Weapon_HornetNest.label>
  <!-- EN: The close to hand hornet nest. They're already angry and willing to sting. Poison build up by too many hornet stings can lead to loss of consciousness and heart attacks. -->
  <Weapon_HornetNest.description>近在咫尺的黄蜂窝。它们已经怒不可遏，随时准备蜇人。若被黄蜂蜇伤过多，体内毒素积聚可能导致意识丧失甚至心脏病发作。</Weapon_HornetNest.description>
  <Weapon_HornetNest.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>大黄蜂巢</Weapon_HornetNest.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
